{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a relaxing, color-filled escape with Color A Cube. This immersive coloring experience lets you explore and bring voxel worlds to life, one cube at a time. Unwind and tap into your creative flow as each brushstroke reveals vibrant, voxel-based environments and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444770/extras/Store_Header_Color_1280_X_200.png?t=1743451668\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444770/extras/Steam_Color-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__1_.gif?t=1743451668\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unwind</strong> and <strong>relax</strong> as you paint vibrant voxel environments and characters. Enjoy the process, discover hidden details, and find calm in every voxelated corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be sure to join our Discord for the latest news and to suggest your ideas!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3444770?t=1743451668","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743451668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444770/91dfe7bdb863ea549b5bb8c6e5259aa2bcd007eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743451668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444770/91dfe7bdb863ea549b5bb8c6e5259aa2bcd007eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743451668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a relaxing, color-filled escape with Color A Cube. This immersive coloring experience lets you explore and bring voxel worlds to life, one cube at a time. Unwind and tap into your creative flow as each brushstroke reveals vibrant, voxel-based environments and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444770/extras/Store_Header_Color_1280_X_200.png?t=1743451668\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444770/extras/Steam_Color-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__1_.gif?t=1743451668\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unwind</strong> and <strong>relax</strong> as you paint vibrant voxel environments and characters. Enjoy the process, discover hidden details, and find calm in every voxelated corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be sure to join our Discord for the latest news and to suggest your ideas!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["AlterEyes"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3366710","name":"Color-A-Cube"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444770/header.jpg?t=1743451668","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257094366,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094366/movie480.mp4?t=1738588705","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094366/movie_max.mp4?t=1738588705"},"name":"Color-A-Cube Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257094366/a766d0d062b9517bebe23f8c740a556b0cb2aea4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738588705","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094366/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738588705","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094366/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=173858870